@startuml state-passenger
!include _style.iuml
skinparam linetype polyline
hide empty description

state "Awaiting payment" as PENDING
state "Confirmed (CNF)" as CNF
state "Waitlisted (WL)" as WL
state "Cancelled (CAN)" as CAN

state allocation <<choice>>

[*] --> PENDING : added to booking
PENDING --> allocation : payment approved
allocation --> CNF : [berth free for segment]\n/ assign coach and berth
allocation --> WL : [no berth, waitlist not full]\n/ assign wl_seq

WL --> CNF : promoted after a cancellation\n[berth free for whole segment]
WL --> CAN : cancelled by user (refund fare minus ₹60),\nat chart preparation or with the train run\n(full refund)
CNF --> CAN : cancelled by user (refund per BR-06)\nor train run cancelled (full refund)

CNF --> [*] : journey completed
CAN --> [*]
@enduml
